    "Move your Bluesky account away" : "Preselite svoj račun Bluesky drugam",
    "Your Bluesky account can live on another server (a PDS). Your followers, posts and handle history move with it; your Fediverse account here stays as it is. Afterwards this server no longer publishes to Bluesky for you." : "Vaš račun Bluesky je lahko na drugem strežniku (PDS). Vaši sledilci, objave in zgodovina ročic se preselijo z njim; vaš račun Fediverse tukaj ostane, kakršen je. Nato ta strežnik za vas ne objavlja več na Bluesky.",
    "Your Bluesky account now lives on {pds} as {handle}." : "Vaš račun Bluesky je zdaj na {pds} kot {handle}.",
