    "The Bluesky account you bring replaces {handle}, the one this server made for you: its posts and followers on Bluesky are not kept." : "Račun Bluesky, ki ga prenesete, nadomesti {handle}, račun, ki ga je ta strežnik ustvaril za vas: njegove objave in sledilci na Bluesky se ne ohranijo.",
