    "_%n post you wrote here was taken off Bluesky by the move. It can be published again from your moved account._::_%n posts you wrote here were taken off Bluesky by the move. They can be published again from your moved account._" : ["%n objavo, ki ste jo napisali tukaj, je selitev umaknila z Bluesky. Iz preseljenega računa jo lahko znova objavite.","%n objavi, ki ste ju napisali tukaj, je selitev umaknila z Bluesky. Iz preseljenega računa ju lahko znova objavite.","%n objave, ki ste jih napisali tukaj, je selitev umaknila z Bluesky. Iz preseljenega računa jih lahko znova objavite.","%n objav, ki ste jih napisali tukaj, je selitev umaknila z Bluesky. Iz preseljenega računa jih lahko znova objavite."],
    "_%n post disappears from Bluesky; you can publish it again afterwards._::_%n posts disappear from Bluesky; you can publish them again afterwards._" : ["%n objava izgine z Bluesky; pozneje jo lahko znova objavite.","%n objavi izgineta z Bluesky; pozneje ju lahko znova objavite.","%n objave izginejo z Bluesky; pozneje jih lahko znova objavite.","%n objav izgine z Bluesky; pozneje jih lahko znova objavite."],
    "Waiting for Bridgy Fed to start" : "Čakanje na zagon Bridgy Fed",
