    "Waiting for your posts" : "Čakanje na vaše objave",
    "{records} posts arrived, {blobs} pictures and videos so far" : "Doslej je prispelo objav: {records}, slik in videoposnetkov: {blobs}",
    "Could not invite the account" : "Računa ni mogoče povabiti",
    "Bring your bridged Bluesky account here" : "Prenesite svoj premoščeni račun Bluesky sem",
    "Server" : "Strežnik",
    "Handle" : "Ročica",
    "E-mail address" : "Elektronski naslov",
    "Password and invite code" : "Geslo in koda povabila",
    "The code is shown only now, works once, and only for this account." : "Koda je prikazana le zdaj, deluje enkrat in le za ta račun.",
    "Bridgy Fed bridges your account to Bluesky as {handle}. That account can live here instead: its followers on Bluesky come along, and Bridgy Fed stops bridging you, since this server reaches Bluesky itself." : "Bridgy Fed premošča vaš račun na Bluesky kot {handle}. Ta račun je lahko namesto tega tukaj: njegovi sledilci na Bluesky se preselijo z njim, Bridgy Fed pa vas preneha premoščati, saj ta strežnik Bluesky doseže sam.",
    "Your account sends Bridgy Fed a direct message asking it to move {twin} here. It replaces {handle}, the Bluesky account this server made for you: that one's posts and followers are not kept." : "Vaš račun pošlje Bridgy Fed neposredno sporočilo s prošnjo, naj {twin} preseli sem. Nadomesti {handle}, račun Bluesky, ki ga je ta strežnik ustvaril za vas: objave in sledilci tega računa se ne ohranijo.",
    "Ask Bridgy Fed" : "Vprašaj Bridgy Fed",
    "A Bluesky account that Bridgy Fed or a migration tool moves can live on this server. Name it, and the server answers what the tool needs." : "Račun Bluesky, ki ga preseli Bridgy Fed ali orodje za selitev, je lahko na tem strežniku. Navedite ga in strežnik bo odgovoril, kar orodje potrebuje.",
    "Gave your bridged account a domain of your own as its handle? Bluesky's search is asked for your Fediverse address to find it." : "Ste premoščenemu računu kot ročico dali lastno domeno? Iskanje Bluesky bo za iskanje uporabilo vaš naslov Fediverse.",
    "No account bridged by Bridgy Fed names your Fediverse account." : "Noben račun, ki ga premošča Bridgy Fed, ne navaja vašega računa Fediverse.",
    "Look for my bridged account on Bluesky" : "Poišči moj premoščeni račun na Bluesky",
    "Another account, with a migration tool" : "Drug račun, z orodjem za selitev",
    "The Bluesky handle or DID to move here" : "Ročica ali DID Bluesky, ki naj se preseli sem",
    "The account you move here replaces {handle}, the Bluesky account this server made for you: that one's posts and followers are not kept." : "Račun, ki ga preselite sem, nadomesti {handle}, račun Bluesky, ki ga je ta strežnik ustvaril za vas: objave in sledilci tega računa se ne ohranijo.",
