    "Could not read your app passwords right now." : "Vaših gesel programov trenutno ni mogoče prebrati.",
    "Could not make an app password with that name" : "Gesla programa s tem imenom ni mogoče ustvariti",
    "Could not make an app password" : "Gesla programa ni mogoče ustvariti",
    "Could not revoke that app password" : "Gesla programa ni mogoče preklicati",
