    "Post, like, follow and read as you" : "Objavljati, označevati kot priljubljeno, slediti in brati v vašem imenu",
    "Know who you are" : "Vedeti, kdo ste",
    "Could not sign the app out" : "Programa ni mogoče odjaviti",
    "Could not change whether your blocks are published" : "Ni mogoče spremeniti, ali so vaše blokade objavljene",
    "Could not switch your presence on Bluesky" : "Vaše prisotnosti na Bluesky ni mogoče preklopiti",
    "Copy the Bluesky handle" : "Kopiraj ročico Bluesky",
    "DID" : "DID",
    "Copy the DID" : "Kopiraj DID",
    "Your Bluesky identity is not registered with the directory yet; this server keeps trying. Your profile and posts go to Bluesky once it is." : "Vaša identiteta Bluesky še ni vpisana v imenik; ta strežnik še naprej poskuša. Ko bo, bodo vaš profil in objave prišli na Bluesky.",
    "Be on Bluesky" : "Bodi na Bluesky",
    "You are not on Bluesky: your profile and posts are not shown there, and nothing new goes there. Bluesky apps are signed out of your account, and your Bluesky messages and notifications are not read." : "Niste na Bluesky: vaš profil in objave tam niso prikazani in nič novega ne gre tja. Programi Bluesky so odjavljeni iz vašega računa, vaša sporočila in obvestila Bluesky pa se ne berejo.",
    "You can still follow and read Bluesky accounts here, but your likes, replies and messages to them stay here. Switched back on, your handle, profile and earlier posts are back; posts written while off stay off Bluesky." : "Račune Bluesky lahko tukaj še vedno spremljate in berete, vendar vaši všečki, odgovori in sporočila zanje ostanejo tukaj. Ko ga znova vklopite, se vrnejo vaša ročica, profil in prejšnje objave; objave, napisane med izklopom, ostanejo zunaj Bluesky.",
    "Switched off, your Bluesky profile and posts are no longer shown there and nothing new goes there. Your handle stays yours, and switching back on brings everything back except what you wrote while off." : "Ko je izklopljen, vaš profil in objave Bluesky tam niso več prikazani in nič novega ne gre tja. Ročica ostane vaša, ponovni vklop pa vrne vse razen tega, kar napišete med izklopom.",
    "Publish my blocks of Bluesky accounts" : "Objavi moje blokade računov Bluesky",
    "Bluesky keeps the accounts you block from replying to you, quoting or mentioning you there. Bluesky blocks are public: anybody can see whom you blocked." : "Bluesky preprečuje računom, ki ste jih blokirali, da bi vam tam odgovarjali, vas citirali ali omenjali. Blokade Bluesky so javne: kdor koli lahko vidi, koga ste blokirali.",
    "Your blocks stay on this server: you do not see those accounts here, but on Bluesky they can still reply to you, quote or mention you. Publishing them stops that, and makes them public, as all Bluesky blocks are." : "Vaše blokade ostanejo na tem strežniku: teh računov tukaj ne vidite, na Bluesky pa vam še vedno lahko odgovarjajo, vas citirajo ali omenjajo. Objava blokad to prepreči in jih naredi javne, kot so vse blokade Bluesky.",
    "Create a new recovery phrase" : "Ustvari novo obnovitveno frazo",
    "Create recovery phrase" : "Ustvari obnovitveno frazo",
    "The phrase you have stops working the moment a new one is made." : "Fraza, ki jo imate, preneha delovati v trenutku, ko je ustvarjena nova.",
    "Twelve words that prove this Bluesky identity is yours even without this server. They are shown once, for you to write down." : "Dvanajst besed, ki dokazujejo, da je ta identiteta Bluesky vaša, tudi brez tega strežnika. Prikazane so enkrat, da si jih zapišete.",
    "Other Bluesky tools do not read the words themselves: the recovery tool below does, and when they are made you also see the key they stand for, written the way tools such as goat take it. This server's key ranks above it, so for 72 hours the server can undo a change made with the phrase, a move to another server included." : "Druga orodja Bluesky samih besed ne berejo: orodje za obnovitev spodaj jih, in ko so ustvarjene, vidite tudi ključ, ki ga predstavljajo, zapisan tako, kot ga sprejemajo orodja, kot je goat. Ključ tega strežnika ima prednost pred njim, zato lahko strežnik 72 ur razveljavi spremembo, narejeno s frazo, vključno s selitvijo na drug strežnik.",
    "Download the recovery tool" : "Prenesi orodje za obnovitev",
    "One page that moves your Bluesky identifier to another server with your twelve words, in your browser, even when this server is gone. Keep it with your words." : "Ena stran, ki z vašimi dvanajstimi besedami v brskalniku preseli vaš identifikator Bluesky na drug strežnik, tudi ko tega strežnika ni več. Hranite jo skupaj z besedami.",
    "Open it here" : "Odpri ga tukaj",
    "Who controls your Bluesky identifier" : "Kdo upravlja vaš identifikator Bluesky",
    "These keys can change where your identifier points, the first one ranking highest:" : "Ti ključi lahko spremenijo, kam kaže vaš identifikator, pri čemer ima prvi najvišjo prednost:",
    "Download your Bluesky account" : "Prenesi račun Bluesky",
    "Your posts, pictures and the history of your Bluesky identifier, in the files Bluesky tools read, with a guide to moving the account even if this server is gone. The archive from the Migration page holds the same files." : "Vaše objave, slike in zgodovina vašega identifikatorja Bluesky v datotekah, ki jih berejo orodja Bluesky, z vodnikom za selitev računa, tudi če tega strežnika ni več. Arhiv s strani Selitev vsebuje iste datoteke.",
    "Open Migration" : "Odpri Selitev",
    "Your own domain as your handle" : "Vaša lastna domena kot ročica",
    "If you own a domain, it can be your Bluesky handle. Your followers stay with you; {assigned} keeps working too." : "Če imate svojo domeno, je ta lahko vaša ročica Bluesky. Vaši sledilci ostanejo z vami; tudi {assigned} še naprej deluje.",
    "Your handle is {handle}." : "Vaša ročica je {handle}.",
    "{handle} no longer names your account. Bluesky shows it as invalid until the DNS record or file is back." : "{handle} ne označuje več vašega računa. Bluesky jo prikazuje kot neveljavno, dokler zapis DNS ali datoteka nista spet na mestu.",
    "Bluesky shows {assigned} as your handle again." : "Bluesky spet prikazuje {assigned} kot vašo ročico.",
    "Use it again" : "Znova jo uporabi",
