    "Sign out" : "Odjava",
    "These twelve words are shown once and never again. Write them down and keep them where only you can find them." : "Teh dvanajst besed je prikazanih enkrat in nikoli več. Zapišite si jih in jih shranite tja, kjer jih lahko najdete le vi.",
    "Keep the twelve words: they are the whole key. Below is the same key written the way other Bluesky tools take it, for when you use one of them." : "Shranite dvanajst besed: so celoten ključ. Spodaj je isti ključ, zapisan tako, kot ga sprejemajo druga orodja Bluesky, za primer, ko uporabite katero od njih.",
    "Leave Bluesky?" : "Zapustim Bluesky?",
    "Every Bluesky app signed in to your account is signed out, and your profile and posts are no longer shown on Bluesky. Posts you write while you are off never reach Bluesky, not even after you switch back on." : "Vsi programi Bluesky, prijavljeni v vaš račun, se odjavijo, vaš profil in objave pa na Bluesky niso več prikazani. Objave, ki jih napišete, ko ste izklopljeni, nikoli ne dosežejo Bluesky, tudi ko znova vklopite.",
