    "Hidden: no likes, dislikes, boosts or replies are counted for you — on your posts, on anybody else's, and in your phone apps — and other people's profiles show no follower number. Who liked a post is still there to look at, and so is your own follower count." : "Skrito: za vas se ne štejejo nobeni všečki, nevšečki, potiski naprej ali odgovori — ne pri vaših objavah, ne pri objavah drugih in ne v aplikacijah na telefonu — profili drugih pa ne prikazujejo števila sledilcev. Kdo je všečkal objavo, si lahko še vedno ogledate, prav tako število svojih sledilcev.",
    "Shown: posts say how many likes, dislikes, boosts and replies they have, and profiles how many followers, here and in your phone apps." : "Prikazano: objave pokažejo, koliko všečkov, nevšečkov, potiskov naprej in odgovorov imajo, profili pa, koliko sledilcev imajo, tukaj in v aplikacijah na telefonu.",
