    "_%n view_::_%n views_" : ["%n ogled","%n ogleda","%n ogledi","%n ogledov"],
    "Could not delete your account" : "Vašega računa ni mogoče izbrisati",
    "Everything you posted from here is deleted, your followers and the people you follow are let go, and every server that knew this account is told it is gone. It cannot be undone, and there is no way to get any of it back afterwards — take an archive from the Export button above first if you might want one." : "Vse, kar ste objavili od tukaj, bo izbrisano, vaši sledilci in ljudje, ki jim sledite, bodo izpuščeni, vsak strežnik, ki je poznal ta račun, pa bo obveščen, da ga ni več. Tega ni mogoče razveljaviti in pozneje ničesar ni mogoče dobiti nazaj – če bi morda želeli arhiv, ga najprej prenesite z gumbom Izvozi zgoraj.",
    "Your account on this server was made for Aloha Social, so it is deleted too, and you are signed out. The handle you are deleting is held for an hour so that nobody else can take it the moment you let it go." : "Vaš račun na tem strežniku je bil ustvarjen za Aloha Social, zato bo izbrisan tudi ta, vi pa boste odjavljeni. Ročica, ki jo brišete, bo zadržana eno uro, da je nihče drug ne more prevzeti takoj, ko jo izpustite.",
    "Your Nextcloud account is not touched: you stay signed in to everything else, and you can make a new Aloha Social account straight away. The handle you are deleting is held for an hour so that nobody else can take it the moment you let it go, so a new account needs a different one." : "Vaš račun Nextcloud ostane nedotaknjen: v vse drugo ostanete prijavljeni in takoj lahko ustvarite nov račun Aloha Social. Ročica, ki jo brišete, bo zadržana eno uro, da je nihče drug ne more prevzeti takoj, ko jo izpustite, zato nov račun potrebuje drugo.",
    "A post that already reached somebody else's server is deleted by asking that server to delete it. Almost all of them do; none of them can be made to." : "Objava, ki je že dosegla strežnik nekoga drugega, se izbriše tako, da se ta strežnik prosi, naj jo izbriše. Skoraj vsi to storijo; nobenega pa ni mogoče prisiliti.",
    "Delete my Aloha Social account" : "Izbriši moj račun Aloha Social",
