    "About For you" : "O viru Za vas",
    "Aloha Social now learns which hashtags interest you from how you read, to build your For you feed. This stays on this server and is only visible to you." : "Aloha Social se zdaj iz tega, kako berete, uči, kateri ključniki vas zanimajo, da sestavi vaš vir Za vas. To ostane na tem strežniku in je vidno le vam.",
