    "Which hashtags you linger on, open, like and skip. It stays on this server and nobody but you sees it." : "Pri katerih ključnikih se zadržite, katere odprete, označite kot priljubljene in preskočite. To ostane na tem strežniku in tega ne vidi nihče razen vas.",
    "Pause learning" : "Začasno ustavi učenje",
    "For a day of reading something unusual. For you keeps working with what it knows, and nothing new is learned or forgotten until you switch this back." : "Za dan, ko berete nekaj nenavadnega. Za vas še naprej deluje s tem, kar ve, nič novega pa se ne nauči ali pozabi, dokler tega znova ne vklopite.",
    "Learning is off, so this list is frozen and For you is hidden. You can still change it, and it is all here when you turn learning back on." : "Učenje je izklopljeno, zato je ta seznam zamrznjen, Za vas pa skrit. Še vedno ga lahko spreminjate in vse bo tukaj, ko učenje znova vklopite.",
    "Still learning what you like. Until it knows more, For you also shows hashtags you follow and what is trending here." : "Še se učimo, kaj vam je všeč. Dokler ne ve več, Za vas prikazuje tudi ključnike, ki jim sledite, in to, kar je tukaj v trendu.",
