    "Forgets everything learned, and the hashtags you added, placed and pinned. Hashtags you follow stay followed." : "Pozabi vse naučeno ter ključnike, ki ste jih dodali, razvrstili in pripeli. Ključnikom, ki jim sledite, boste še naprej sledili.",
    "Reset all interests?" : "Ali želite ponastaviti vsa zanimanja?",
    "Everything Aloha Social has learned about what you like goes, with the hashtags you added and the order you gave them. It starts learning again from nothing. This cannot be undone." : "Vse, kar se je Aloha Social naučil o tem, kaj vam je všeč, bo odstranjeno, skupaj s ključniki, ki ste jih dodali, in vrstnim redom, ki ste jim ga dali. Znova se začne učiti iz nič. Tega ni mogoče razveljaviti.",
