    "Held people can still write to you. Their posts, likes and follows wait in Activities until you look; they do not ring, push or mail." : "Zadržani ljudje vam še vedno lahko pišejo. Njihove objave, všečki in sledenja čakajo v Dejavnostih, dokler ne pogledate; ne zvonijo, ne pošiljajo potisnih obvestil in ne pošte.",
