    "_{count} follower_::_{count} followers_" : ["{count} sledilec","{count} sledilca","{count} sledilci","{count} sledilcev"],
    "A <link rel=\"me\"> in the page's <head> does the same, and rel=\"me noopener\" counts as well: the server looks for \"me\" among the rel words of any anchor or link on the page. The address has to be your own profile address, the one in the line above; a trailing slash or a #fragment makes no difference." : "Enako naredi <link rel=\"me\"> v elementu <head> strani, šteje pa tudi rel=\"me noopener\": strežnik išče »me« med besedami rel katerekoli sidra ali povezave na strani. Naslov mora biti naslov vašega profila, tisti iz vrstice zgoraj; poševnica na koncu ali #fragment ne spremenita ničesar.",
    "This server fetches the page itself, in the background, at most once a day per account, over http or https only, and reads the first part of it. A page it cannot reach is left unverified and asked again later, and a page that stops linking back loses its tick." : "Ta strežnik stran pridobi sam, v ozadju, največ enkrat na dan za vsak račun, le prek http ali https, in prebere njen prvi del. Stran, ki je ne more doseči, ostane nepreverjena in jo vpraša znova pozneje, stran, ki preneha povezovati nazaj, pa izgubi kljukico.",
    "{used} of {max} fields used. Remove one, or empty the pronouns or the support link, to save." : "Uporabljenih polj: {used} od {max}. Za shranjevanje odstranite eno ali izpraznite zaimke ali povezavo za podporo.",
