    "Detach this quote" : "Odstrani ta citat",
    "Detaching tells the other server, which then shows the quote as withdrawn. The post itself is theirs and stays where it is." : "Odstranitev obvesti drugi strežnik, ki nato citat prikaže kot umaknjen. Sama objava je njihova in ostane, kjer je.",
    "This quote is waiting for the quoted author to approve it." : "Ta citat čaka, da ga avtor citirane objave odobri.",
    "The author of the quoted post did not allow this quote." : "Avtor citirane objave ni dovolil tega citata.",
    "The author of the quoted post withdrew their permission for this quote." : "Avtor citirane objave je umaknil dovoljenje za ta citat.",
    "The quoted post is not available." : "Citirana objava ni na voljo.",
    "The quoted post quotes another post." : "Citirana objava citira drugo objavo.",
    "Open the quoted post" : "Odpri citirano objavo",
    "Choose a reaction" : "Izberite odziv",
    "Choose an emoji" : "Izberite izrazno ikono",
    "Show me how my week went" : "Pokaži mi, kako je minil moj teden",
    "A line at the top of your feed, once a week, saying how many times you posted. Nobody else sees it, and there is no streak to keep up." : "Vrstica na vrhu vašega vira, enkrat na teden, ki pove, kolikokrat ste objavili. Nihče drug je ne vidi in ni niza, ki bi ga morali vzdrževati.",
    "Could not change who can reply" : "Ni mogoče spremeniti, kdo lahko odgovori",
    "This decides what happens from now on. Replies already posted stay. You can always reply yourself." : "To določa, kaj se zgodi od zdaj naprej. Že objavljeni odgovori ostanejo. Sami lahko vedno odgovorite.",
    "Could not load your scheduled posts" : "Vaših načrtovanih objav ni mogoče naložiti",
    "Moved to {date}" : "Premaknjeno na {date}",
    "Could not change the time of the scheduled post" : "Časa načrtovane objave ni mogoče spremeniti",
