    "The registration is deleted and the person is emailed. You can tell them why." : "Registracija bo izbrisana, oseba pa bo obveščena po e-pošti. Lahko ji poveste zakaj.",
    "Could not save the settings" : "Nastavitev ni mogoče shraniti",
    "Could not change who may open Aloha Social" : "Ni mogoče spremeniti, kdo lahko odpre Aloha Social",
    "Could not change the two-factor setting" : "Nastavitve dvostopenjske overitve ni mogoče spremeniti",
    "They sign in on the normal login page and can use Aloha Social and nothing else: no Files, no Talk, and nobody outside Aloha Social can find them." : "Prijavijo se na običajni prijavni strani in lahko uporabljajo Aloha Social in nič drugega: brez Datotek, brez Talka, in nihče zunaj Aloha Social jih ne more najti.",
    "Aloha Social is limited to some groups, and external users are not in them, so they could register and then not open Aloha Social." : "Aloha Social je omejen na nekatere skupine, zunanji uporabniki pa niso v njih, zato bi se lahko registrirali, nato pa Aloha Social ne bi mogli odpreti.",
