    "Only people with an invitation link" : "Le ljudje s povezavo s povabilom",
    "An invitation link admits its holder whichever you choose, without approval." : "Povezava s povabilom sprejme imetnika ne glede na izbiro, brez odobritve.",
    "Confirm the email address before the account is made" : "Potrdi elektronski naslov, preden je račun ustvarjen",
    "Let everybody here send invitation links" : "Dovoli vsem tukaj pošiljanje povezav s povabilom",
    "Usernames nobody may register, one per line" : "Uporabniška imena, ki jih nihče ne sme registrirati, eno na vrstico",
    "Additional registration and privacy information" : "Dodatni podatki o registraciji in zasebnosti",
    "Shown before people enter their details. Plain text only; adapt this information to your instance. It is not legal advice. When acceptance is required, changing this text creates a new notice version." : "Prikazano, preden ljudje vpišejo svoje podatke. Le navadno besedilo; te podatke prilagodite svojemu strežniku. To ni pravni nasvet. Kadar je sprejetje obvezno, sprememba tega besedila ustvari novo različico obvestila.",
    "Require registrants to accept this notice" : "Zahtevaj, da registranti sprejmejo to obvestilo",
    "The accepted notice version and time are kept with the account until the account is deleted. This records acceptance; it does not make the notice legally sufficient." : "Sprejeta različica obvestila in čas se hranita z računom, dokler ni račun izbrisan. To beleži sprejetje; obvestila pa ne naredi pravno zadostnega.",
    "Require two-factor authentication" : "Zahtevaj dvostopenjsko overitev",
    "This server requires two-factor authentication of everybody. Switching this off exempts external users." : "Ta strežnik zahteva dvostopenjsko overitev od vseh. Izklop tega izvzame zunanje uporabnike.",
    "External users then set up an authenticator app or a security key when they first log in. This is Nextcloud's own setting, the same as in Administration → Security." : "Zunanji uporabniki ob prvi prijavi nastavijo program za overjanje ali varnostni ključ. To je lastna nastavitev Nextcloud, enaka kot v Skrbništvo → Varnost.",
