    "_%n delivery waiting to be sent._::_%n deliveries waiting to be sent._" : ["%n dostava čaka na pošiljanje.","%n dostavi čakata na pošiljanje.","%n dostave čakajo na pošiljanje.","%n dostav čaka na pošiljanje."],
    "_%n is being sent right now._::_%n are being sent right now._" : ["%n se pošilja prav zdaj.","%n se pošiljata prav zdaj.","%n se pošiljajo prav zdaj.","%n se pošilja prav zdaj."],
    "_%n delivery has failed at least once._::_%n deliveries have failed at least once._" : ["%n dostava vsaj enkrat ni uspela.","%n dostavi vsaj enkrat nista uspeli.","%n dostave vsaj enkrat niso uspele.","%n dostav vsaj enkrat ni uspelo."],
    "_%n of them is close to being given up on._::_%n of them are close to being given up on._" : ["%n od njih je blizu opustitve.","%n od njih sta blizu opustitve.","%n od njih so blizu opustitve.","%n od njih je blizu opustitve."],
    "_Nothing has been given up on in the last %n day._::_Nothing has been given up on in the last %n days._" : ["V zadnjem %n dnevu ni bilo nič opuščeno.","V zadnjih %n dneh ni bilo nič opuščeno.","V zadnjih %n dneh ni bilo nič opuščeno.","V zadnjih %n dneh ni bilo nič opuščeno."],
    "_%n delivery was given up on: that server never got it._::_%n deliveries were given up on: those servers never got them._" : ["%n dostava je bila opuščena: ta strežnik je ni nikoli prejel.","%n dostavi sta bili opuščeni: ti strežniki ju niso nikoli prejeli.","%n dostave so bile opuščene: ti strežniki jih niso nikoli prejeli.","%n dostav je bilo opuščenih: ti strežniki jih niso nikoli prejeli."],
    "_Counted over the last %n day, which is how long a finished delivery is kept._::_Counted over the last %n days, which is how long a finished delivery is kept._" : ["Šteto v zadnjem %n dnevu, kolikor dolgo se hrani končana dostava.","Šteto v zadnjih %n dneh, kolikor dolgo se hrani končana dostava.","Šteto v zadnjih %n dneh, kolikor dolgo se hrani končana dostava.","Šteto v zadnjih %n dneh, kolikor dolgo se hrani končana dostava."],
    "Half-life (days)" : "Razpolovna doba (dnevi)",
    "How fast an interest fades when it is no longer read. After this many days a score is worth half." : "Kako hitro zanimanje zbledi, ko se ne bere več. Po tolikih dneh je ocena vredna polovico.",
    "Listing threshold" : "Prag za uvrstitev",
    "The score a learned hashtag needs before it counts as an interest. Lower learns faster and guesses more." : "Ocena, ki jo naučeni ključnik potrebuje, da šteje kot zanimanje. Nižja se uči hitreje in več ugiba.",
    "Interests per person" : "Zanimanj na osebo",
    "The most hashtags one person's list holds." : "Največ ključnikov na seznamu ene osebe.",
    "Feed window (days)" : "Okno vira (dnevi)",
    "How far back the feed looks for posts. Longer finds more for rare interests and costs more to rank." : "Kako daleč nazaj vir išče objave. Daljše najde več za redka zanimanja, a razvrščanje stane več.",
    "A whole number from {min} to {max}" : "Celo število od {min} do {max}",
    "A number from {min} to {max}" : "Število od {min} do {max}",
    "Could not save the For you settings" : "Nastavitev vira Za vas ni mogoče shraniti",
    "Enable For you" : "Omogoči Za vas",
    "Off hides the feed and the settings, and nothing is learned. What was learned is kept, so turning it back on brings everybody's interests back." : "Izklop skrije vir in nastavitve, nič pa se ne nauči. Naučeno se ohrani, zato ponovni vklop vsem vrne njihova zanimanja.",
    "Learn from browsing unless a user turns it off" : "Uči se iz brskanja, razen če uporabnik to izklopi",
    "The GDPR-relevant choice: off makes learning opt-in, and each person is invited to turn it on. A user's own choice always wins." : "Izbira, pomembna za GDPR: izklop naredi učenje izbirno, vsakogar pa povabi, naj ga vklopi. Lastna izbira uporabnika vedno prevlada.",
