    "Why, for whoever reads this next year" : "Zakaj – za tistega, ki bo to bral naslednje leto",
    "Refuse this file" : "Zavrni to datoteko",
    "The checksum of a file is what sha256sum prints for it. It matches that exact file: a re-encoded or re-cropped copy is a different file and is not caught." : "Kontrolna vsota datoteke je tisto, kar zanjo izpiše sha256sum. Ujema se natanko s to datoteko: znova kodirana ali obrezana kopija je druga datoteka in ni zajeta.",
