    "The relay has been asked" : "Rele je bil vprašan",
    "Could not subscribe to that relay" : "Na ta rele se ni mogoče naročiti",
    "Could not unsubscribe from that relay" : "Naročnine na ta rele ni mogoče preklicati",
    "What is shared is public posts and nothing else: a followers-only post has an audience that was chosen, and a relay is the opposite of a chosen audience. Nothing a person on this server writes privately ever reaches one." : "Deli se le javne objave in nič drugega: objava samo za sledilce ima izbrano občinstvo, rele pa je nasprotje izbranega občinstva. Nič, kar oseba na tem strežniku napiše zasebno, ga nikoli ne doseže.",
    "The relay's address" : "Naslov releja",
    "Relays publish this address on their own front page; it usually ends in /actor or /inbox." : "Releji ta naslov objavljajo na svoji naslovni strani; običajno se konča z /actor ali /inbox.",
