    "Keep posts from other servers for (days)" : "Objave z drugih strežnikov hrani (dni)",
    "Kept anyway: direct messages, posts somebody here liked, boosted, bookmarked or replied under, and posts by people somebody here follows. Posts written here are never deleted." : "Vseeno se hranijo: neposredna sporočila, objave, ki jih je nekdo tukaj označil kot priljubljene, potisnil naprej, dodal med zaznamke ali pod njimi odgovoril, ter objave ljudi, ki jim nekdo tukaj sledi. Objave, napisane tukaj, se nikoli ne izbrišejo.",
    "The post is deleted and its author is told. This cannot be undone: nothing of it is kept here afterwards." : "Objava bo izbrisana, avtor pa obveščen. Tega ni mogoče razveljaviti: nič od nje se tukaj potem ne hrani.",
