    "_One account could not be reached from this server:_::_%n accounts could not be reached from this server:_" : ["S tega strežnika ni bilo mogoče doseči %n računa:","S tega strežnika ni bilo mogoče doseči %n računov:","S tega strežnika ni bilo mogoče doseči %n računov:","S tega strežnika ni bilo mogoče doseči %n računov:"],
    "Add some with the starter_packs app setting, or read them in from other servers with starter_pack_sources." : "Dodajte jih z nastavitvijo programa starter_packs ali jih preberite z drugih strežnikov s starter_pack_sources.",
    "This server does not suggest any starter packs yet." : "Ta strežnik še ne predlaga nobenih začetnih paketov.",
    "Videos people are watching will appear here." : "Tukaj bodo prikazani videoposnetki, ki jih ljudje gledajo.",
    "Pictures people are looking at will appear here." : "Tukaj bodo prikazane slike, ki si jih ljudje ogledujejo.",
    "Packs" : "Paketi",
    "Pictures" : "Slike",
    "Tags" : "Oznake",
    "Could not open this pack. The server may be busy." : "Tega paketa ni mogoče odpreti. Strežnik je morda zaseden.",
    "What to discover" : "Kaj odkriti",
    "Nothing to discover yet" : "Še ni ničesar za odkrivanje",
    "All starter packs" : "Vsi začetni paketi",
    "Their server did not answer. Often it is only busy for a moment. If this Nextcloud cannot be reached from the internet, some servers never answer it." : "Njihov strežnik ni odgovoril. Pogosto je le za trenutek zaseden. Če ta Nextcloud ni dosegljiv z interneta, mu nekateri strežniki nikoli ne odgovorijo.",
    "No starter packs" : "Ni začetnih paketov",
    "Your island and its neighbours" : "Vaš otok in njegovi sosedje",
    "Every server in the fediverse is an island. Following somebody on another one opens a canoe route to it, and their posts travel to you along that route." : "Vsak strežnik v fediverse je otok. Ko sledite nekomu na drugem, se odpre pot s kanujem do njega, njegove objave pa po njej potujejo do vas.",
    "Search the fediverse" : "Iskanje po fediverse",
    "Names and handles in public directories, including people on servers this one has never met. Somebody who is not listed is found by their full handle, like @someone@example.org or @someone.example.com, in the search at the top of the sidebar." : "Imena in ročice v javnih imenikih, vključno z ljudmi na strežnikih, ki jih ta še ni srečal. Nekoga, ki ni naveden, najdete po njegovi polni ročici, na primer @someone@example.org ali @someone.example.com, v iskanju na vrhu stranske vrstice.",
    "Names and handles in public directories, including people on servers this one has never met. Somebody who is not listed is found by their full handle, like @someone@example.org, in the search at the top of the sidebar." : "Imena in ročice v javnih imenikih, vključno z ljudmi na strežnikih, ki jih ta še ni srečal. Nekoga, ki ni naveden, najdete po njegovi polni ročici, na primer @someone@example.org, v iskanju na vrhu stranske vrstice.",
    "Because of who you follow" : "Zaradi tega, komu sledite",
    "The people you follow follow other people. This asks their servers who, and puts the ones several of them share first." : "Ljudje, ki jim sledite, sledijo drugim ljudem. To vpraša njihove strežnike, komu, in najprej prikaže tiste, ki jih deli več od njih.",
    "Suggested on Bluesky" : "Predlagano na Bluesky",
    "People Bluesky suggests to you, from who you follow there. Follow them here like anybody else." : "Ljudje, ki vam jih predlaga Bluesky glede na to, komu sledite tam. Sledite jim tukaj kot komurkoli drugemu.",
    "People this server knows" : "Ljudje, ki jih ta strežnik pozna",
    "Accounts on this Nextcloud, and the ones it has met through the people here." : "Računi na tem Nextcloudu in tisti, ki jih je srečal prek ljudi tukaj.",
    "On your Nextcloud" : "Na vašem Nextcloudu",
    "Nobody here yet" : "Tukaj še ni nikogar",
    "Accounts this server has met will appear here. Until it has met any, the search above asks other servers’ directories instead." : "Tukaj bodo prikazani računi, ki jih je ta strežnik srečal. Dokler ni srečal nobenega, iskanje zgoraj namesto tega sprašuje imenike drugih strežnikov.",
    "Failed to load follow requests" : "Prošenj za sledenje ni mogoče naložiti",
    "Failed to accept the follow request" : "Prošnje za sledenje ni mogoče sprejeti",
    "Failed to reject the follow request" : "Prošnje za sledenje ni mogoče zavrniti",
    "No pending follow requests" : "Ni čakajočih prošenj za sledenje",
    "When your account is locked, people asking to follow you show up here." : "Ko je vaš račun zaklenjen, so tukaj prikazani ljudje, ki vas prosijo za sledenje.",
    "Change that in your account settings." : "To spremenite v nastavitvah računa.",
    "Load more" : "Naloži več",
    "Your account is yours. Take a copy of it whenever you like, move it to another server, or bring one here from somewhere else — including the posts you wrote there, with their pictures." : "Vaš račun je vaš. Kopijo si naredite, kadar želite, preselite ga na drug strežnik ali pa sem prenesite račun od drugod – vključno z objavami, ki ste jih tam napisali, in njihovimi slikami.",
    "Page not found" : "Strani ni mogoče najti",
    "There is nothing at this address. The link may be wrong, or what it pointed to has moved." : "Na tem naslovu ni ničesar. Povezava je morda napačna ali pa je bilo to, na kar je kazala, premaknjeno.",
    "Back to my feed" : "Nazaj na moj vir",
    "Read all of your data" : "Brati vse vaše podatke",
