    "Public posts that were taken here, as their posters said. A place is never worked out from a picture — it is only ever what somebody chose to say." : "Javne objave, posnete tukaj, kot so navedli njihovi avtorji. Kraj se nikoli ne izračuna iz slike – vedno je le to, kar je nekdo izbral povedati.",
