    "_{counted} post, all of them_::_{counted} posts, all of them_" : ["{counted} objava, vse","{counted} objavi, obe","{counted} objave, vse","{counted} objav, vse"],
    "Estimated reach" : "Ocenjeni doseg",
    "Sum of the per-post estimates" : "Vsota ocen posameznih objav",
    "Interactions" : "Interakcije",
    "Likes, boosts and replies together" : "Všečki, potiski naprej in odgovori skupaj",
    "As far as this server was told" : "Kolikor je bilo sporočeno temu strežniku",
    "Boosts" : "Potiski naprej",
    "{label}: {now} over the last {days} days, against {before} over the {days} before them." : "{label}: {now} v zadnjih {days} dneh v primerjavi s {before} v {days} dneh pred tem.",
    "Reach is an estimate: your followers today, plus the followers of everybody who boosted the post. Audiences that overlap are counted twice, and nobody can count the people who saw a post without touching it." : "Doseg je ocena: vaši današnji sledilci in sledilci vseh, ki so objavo potisnili naprej. Občinstva, ki se prekrivajo, so šteta dvakrat, ljudi, ki so objavo videli, ne da bi se je dotaknili, pa ne more prešteti nihče.",
    "_The audience of one account that boosted you is not known here, and counts as nobody._::_The audiences of {count} accounts that boosted you are not known here, and count as nobody._" : ["Občinstvo {count} računa, ki vas je potisnil naprej, tukaj ni znano in šteje kot nihče.","Občinstvi {count} računov, ki sta vas potisnila naprej, tukaj nista znani in štejeta kot nihče.","Občinstva {count} računov, ki so vas potisnili naprej, tukaj niso znana in štejejo kot nihče.","Občinstva {count} računov, ki so vas potisnili naprej, tukaj niso znana in štejejo kot nihče."],
