    "What you have posted here, and what came back. Counted from this server when you opened the page, so it is never a stale number." : "Kaj ste objavili tukaj in kaj se je vrnilo. Šteto s tega strežnika, ko ste odprli stran, zato število nikoli ni zastarelo.",
