    "Now" : "Zdaj",
    "Before" : "Prej",
    "Both windows are the same length, so the pair is worth reading. A post counts on the day it went out, together with everything it has collected since." : "Obe obdobji sta enako dolgi, zato je primerjava smiselna. Objava šteje na dan, ko je odšla, skupaj z vsem, kar je od takrat zbrala.",
