    "_{days} day. Directly comparable._::_{days} days. Directly comparable._" : ["{days} dan. Neposredno primerljivo.","{days} dneva. Neposredno primerljivo.","{days} dnevi. Neposredno primerljivo.","{days} dni. Neposredno primerljivo."],
    "_%n person followed you after joining through one of your starter packs._::_%n people followed you after joining through one of your starter packs._" : ["%n oseba vam je začela slediti, potem ko se je pridružila prek enega od vaših začetnih paketov.","%n osebi sta vam začeli slediti, potem ko sta se pridružili prek enega od vaših začetnih paketov.","%n osebe so vam začele slediti, potem ko so se pridružile prek enega od vaših začetnih paketov.","%n oseb vam je začelo slediti, potem ko so se pridružile prek enega od vaših začetnih paketov."],
    "_%n of these posts also went out on {network}._::_%n of these posts also went out on {network}._" : ["%n od teh objav je bila objavljena tudi na {network}.","%n od teh objav sta bili objavljeni tudi na {network}.","%n od teh objav so bile objavljene tudi na {network}.","%n od teh objav je bilo objavljenih tudi na {network}."],
    "_picture posted_::_pictures posted_" : ["objavljena slika","objavljeni sliki","objavljene slike","objavljenih slik"],
    "Settings → Your account → Download an archive of your data, and wait for the mail. Your posts and their pictures are in it. The accounts you followed are in it only as numbers, so there is nobody in that file to look up — and nothing on X federates, so no follower can come with you." : "Nastavitve → Vaš račun → Prenesi arhiv podatkov, nato počakajte na sporočilo. V njem so vaše objave in njihove slike. Računi, ki ste jim sledili, so v njem le kot številke, zato v tej datoteki ni nikogar za iskanje – na X pa se nič ne federira, zato z vami ne more priti noben sledilec.",
    "Settings → Accounts Centre → Your information and permissions → Download your information, and choose JSON. The HTML download holds the pages and not the posts. Your posts, your reels and the list of accounts you follow are all in that one file." : "Nastavitve → Središče za račune → Vaši podatki in dovoljenja → Prenos podatkov, nato izberite JSON. Prenos HTML vsebuje strani, ne objav. Vaše objave, posnetki reels in seznam računov, ki jim sledite, so vsi v tej eni datoteki.",
    "Settings → Account → Download your data. The archive holds your videos as files rather than as posts, so there is nothing here that can read it as a timeline yet." : "Nastavitve → Račun → Prenesi podatke. Arhiv vsebuje vaše videoposnetke kot datoteke in ne kot objave, zato tukaj še ni ničesar, kar bi ga lahko prebralo kot časovnico.",
    "TikTok posts cannot be imported from the archive yet. A video at a time can still be brought over by its address from Settings → Moving in, and everything below this step works the same." : "Objav TikTok iz arhiva še ni mogoče uvoziti. Po en videoposnetek je še vedno mogoče prenesti po njegovem naslovu v Nastavitve → Selitev sem, vse pod tem korakom pa deluje enako.",
    "Google Takeout → YouTube and YouTube Music. The archive holds your videos as files rather than as posts, so there is nothing here that can read it as a timeline yet." : "Google Takeout → YouTube in YouTube Music. Arhiv vsebuje vaše videoposnetke kot datoteke in ne kot objave, zato tukaj še ni ničesar, kar bi ga lahko prebralo kot časovnico.",
    "Your own uploads are yours to re-publish rather than something to import in bulk — they are whole videos, and each one belongs on a post you write." : "Vaše lastne naložene vsebine so vaše za ponovno objavo in ne nekaj za množični uvoz – to so celi videoposnetki in vsak sodi v objavo, ki jo napišete.",
    "_Brought over %n post._::_Brought over %n posts._" : ["Prenesena %n objava.","Preneseni %n objavi.","Prenesene %n objave.","Prenesenih %n objav."],
    "There are more: run it again to carry on." : "Jih je še več: za nadaljevanje ga zaženite znova.",
    "That archive could not be read" : "Tega arhiva ni mogoče prebrati",
    "That archive lists nobody to look up" : "Ta arhiv ne navaja nikogar za iskanje",
    "Could not look those names up" : "Teh imen ni mogoče poiskati",
    "Could not follow those accounts" : "Tem računom ni mogoče slediti",
    "I have moved to the fediverse" : "Zdaj sem v fediverse",
    "Follow me from any fediverse account — no account here needed" : "Sledite mi s katerega koli računa v fediverse – račun tukaj ni potreben",
    "Could not copy — the words are below, to select" : "Kopiranje ni uspelo – besede so spodaj, da jih izberete",
    "Move in from somewhere else" : "Preselite se sem od drugod",
    "Your posts, the people you follow and a way to tell everyone where you went. Nothing here is posted for you, and nothing leaves this server except the lookups you ask for." : "Vaše objave, ljudje, ki jim sledite, in način, kako vsem sporočiti, kam ste šli. Nič se tukaj ne objavi namesto vas in nič ne zapusti tega strežnika razen iskanj, za katera prosite.",
    "Where are you coming from?" : "Od kod prihajate?",
    "Bring your posts" : "Prinesite svoje objave",
    "Reading your archive …" : "Branje vašega arhiva …",
    "Choose your archive" : "Izberite svoj arhiv",
    "Your posts are written here with the dates they were written on, and nothing is sent to anyone: importing cannot put years of old posts into other people's timelines." : "Vaše objave so tukaj zapisane z datumi, ko so bile napisane, in nikomur se nič ne pošlje: uvoz ne more spraviti let starih objav na časovnice drugih ljudi.",
    "Find the people you followed" : "Poiščite ljudi, ki ste jim sledili",
    "Instagram names are Threads names, and Threads is part of the fediverse — so the accounts you already followed can be looked up here, one at a time, from the same archive. Everyone who answers is shown; nobody is followed until you say so." : "Imena na Instagramu so imena na Threads, Threads pa je del fediverse – zato je račune, ki ste jim že sledili, mogoče poiskati tukaj, enega za drugim, iz istega arhiva. Prikazan je vsak, ki se odzove; nikomur ne sledite, dokler tega ne potrdite.",
    "Read the list from my archive" : "Preberi seznam iz mojega arhiva",
    "Choose your archive above first" : "Najprej zgoraj izberite svoj arhiv",
    "Keep looking" : "Išči naprej",
    "Fill your feed" : "Napolnite svoj vir",
    "A timeline here is what you followed and nothing else — there is no algorithm deciding what you get. Which means the first day is yours to fill: the starter packs are handfuls of accounts by subject, and following a hashtag brings in everyone who writes about it, whether you follow them or not." : "Časovnica tukaj je to, čemur sledite, in nič drugega – ni algoritma, ki bi odločal, kaj dobite. Kar pomeni, da je prvi dan na vas, da jo napolnite: začetni paketi so peščice računov po temah, sledenje ključniku pa prinese vse, ki pišejo o njem, ne glede na to, ali jim sledite.",
    "Browse starter packs" : "Prebrskaj začetne pakete",
    "Follow hashtags" : "Sledi ključnikom",
    "Tell people where you went" : "Povejte ljudem, kam ste šli",
    "The one part nobody can do for you: none of those networks lets another site post on your behalf. Here is the card and the words — put them where you used to be, once, and the people still there can find you." : "Edini del, ki ga nihče ne more narediti namesto vas: nobeno od teh omrežij ne dovoli drugemu spletišču objavljati v vašem imenu. Tukaj sta kartica in besedilo – enkrat ju objavite tam, kjer ste bili prej, in ljudje, ki so še tam, vas bodo našli.",
    "A card naming your new account" : "Kartica z vašim novim računom",
    "Your address could not be read, so the card and the words are not ready yet." : "Vašega naslova ni mogoče prebrati, zato kartica in besedilo še nista pripravljena.",
    "Save the card" : "Shrani kartico",
