    "These figures are for the fediverse only. {networks} publishes no count of its accounts that could be quoted here, so it is not included." : "Te številke veljajo le za fediverse. {networks} ne objavlja števila svojih računov, ki bi ga lahko navedli tukaj, zato ni vključen.",
    "Translated by {provider}" : "Prevedel {provider}",
    "One step is left, on your old server: tell it to move your followers here. On Mastodon that is Preferences → Account → Move to a different account; enter {handle} there." : "Ostal je še en korak, na vašem starem strežniku: naročite mu, naj vaše sledilce preseli sem. Na Mastodonu je to Nastavitve → Račun → Selitev na drug račun; tam vpišite {handle}.",
    "The latest change was made on {date}. Until {until}, it can still be undone by: {keys}." : "Zadnja sprememba je bila narejena {date}. Do {until} jo še lahko razveljavijo: {keys}.",
