    "The posts of the people and hashtags you follow. Not your lists: a list timeline is never filtered." : "Objave ljudi in ključnikov, ki jim sledite. Ne vaši seznami: časovnica seznama ni nikoli filtrirana.",
    "Mentions, boosts, favourites and the rest of your notifications. Here only taking the post out has any effect: a notification is never folded." : "Omembe, potiski naprej, priljubljene in druga obvestila. Tukaj učinkuje le odstranitev objave: obvestilo se nikoli ne zloži.",
